      "description": "Average power of each charge session. The two populations separate cleanly without needing any classification: AC charging at home sits near 1 kW, DC rapid charging at 44-56 kW average with peaks to 76.5 kW.\n\nWorth knowing: the sessions bot hard-codes charge_type to \"unknown\" and never distinguishes the two, so this panel is the only place the split is visible.\n\nSessions under 60 s are excluded. One on 2026-07-23 closed with duration 0.232 s, which computes to 186,207 kW and would otherwise flatten the axis.",
